refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.description;
public intCachingIterator::getFlags
Gets the bitmask of the flags used for this CachingIterator instance.

  &reftitle.examples;

   Checking whether a flag is set


<?php
$iterator = new CachingIterator(
    new ArrayIterator(['a', 'b', 'c']),
    CachingIterator::TOSTRING_USE_KEY | CachingIterator::FULL_CACHE
);

var_dump((bool) ($iterator->getFlags() & CachingIterator::FULL_CACHE));
var_dump((bool) ($iterator->getFlags() & CachingIterator::CALL_TOSTRING));
?>


   &example.outputs;


bool(true)
bool(false)
